        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"82f900d0-e039-45ef-a60e-184e11473bb2\",\"review_text\":\"Very good. Lots of music to choose from.\"},{\"review_id\":\"8de17d86-e8d9-4967-8a12-47cbc15aa8d9\",\"review_text\":\"Great app for all of your music 👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"1de6a7f6-fd84-4072-bd3b-fe6ed38f9f1f\",\"review_text\":\"Love the app.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7c7c202a-741a-4942-8724-71daad7bf27a\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify, STOP ADDING A SONGS THAT I DONT ADD IN MY PLAYLIST. ITS SO ANNOYING. I JUST WANT TO HEAR A SONG'S THAT I ADD IN MY PLAYLIST. NOT WHAT YOU ADD IN MY PLAYLIST, DUDE, ITS MY PLAYLIST, NOT YOURS. SO, STOP ADDING A SONG THAT I DONT WANT TO HEAR IN MY PLAYLIST. MY. PLAYLIST. NOT. YOURS.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ef4ef746-0305-4cfc-9c5d-6047cb5b1895\",\"review_text\":\"Really sucks you can't even find the songs your looking for without digging in playlists, You also can't even listen to your songs without Spotify adding stuff\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc0b0531-6f7b-4dfa-a206-23de12d5e89f\",\"review_text\":\"I listen everyday\"},{\"review_id\":\"b9911861-2279-4535-ad19-0da05a2c7fe8\",\"review_text\":\"I love. Make lyrics searchable plz\"},{\"review_id\":\"3dc06a09-671b-40aa-b5ee-c6b9a6f23c45\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing love it\"},{\"review_id\":\"764c4adb-4393-44d9-b627-26c57df0951e\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome in love with this 🤩\"},{\"review_id\":\"91718b40-4163-48e4-ad83-4a9c3a7a18a4\",\"review_text\":\"Works great lots of music new and old.\"}]}"
